---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Jack Zeis runs ZeisWorks from Golden, Colorado — a one-person growth practice for independent service businesses. AI-powered marketing plans, hands-on execution."
  ogTitle="About | zeisWorks"
  ogDescription="Jack Zeis runs ZeisWorks from Golden, CO. One person. No agency. AI-powered marketing plans supervised by a real person. Helping independent service businesses get more clients."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 space-y-16">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-orange uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">About</p>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-semibold text-ink leading-tight">
        Why this exists
      </h1>
    </div>

    <!-- Bio section -->
    <section class="space-y-5 text-ink-mid leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        I grew up around a small business. Watched my dad do everything right and still lose sleep over the same question: how do I keep up?
      </p>
      <p>
        Not with competitors. With technology. With the way customers find businesses now. With what good marketing actually looks like in 2026.
      </p>
      <p>
        I spent the years since learning exactly that. Building sales and marketing systems for organizations with real budgets, then watching those same tools become accessible to anyone who knows how to run them.
      </p>
      <p>
        ZeisWorks is the answer to the question my dad never had a good answer to. One person. No agency. Just someone who knows what works and will tell you straight.
      </p>
      <p class="text-ink font-medium pt-2">
        Jack Zeis runs ZeisWorks, a modern growth practice for independent service businesses. Based in Golden, Colorado.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Three pillars -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-6">Three connected services</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        {[
          { num: '01', name: 'Get found', href: '/marketing', desc: 'How your business shows up on Google, in local search, and in the places your customers are already looking.' },
          { num: '02', name: 'Turn attention into leads', href: '/operations', desc: 'Getting found is step one. Converting that attention into calls, bookings, and revenue is step two. Most businesses stop at step one.' },
          { num: '03', name: 'Build systems that stick', href: '/custom-tools', desc: 'The tools and processes that make growth repeatable. So it does not depend on you doing more.' },
        ].map(p => (
          <a href={p.href} class="block rounded-xl border border-cream-dark bg-cream p-6 hover:border-navy/30 transition-colors group">
            <p class="text-xs text-orange font-medium uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">{p.num}</p>
            <h3 class="font-serif font-semibold text-ink text-lg mb-2 group-hover:text-navy transition-colors">{p.name}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-mid">{p.desc}</p>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Trust elements -->
    <section class="rounded-xl border border-cream-dark bg-cream-dark p-8">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-6">How ZeisWorks works</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-4">
        {[
          { label: 'No retainer required', body: 'Work can be project-based or ongoing. You don\'t commit to anything until you see the scope and the price.' },
          { label: 'Free first call', body: 'The first conversation is always free. So is the plan. You only pay if you decide to work together.' },
          { label: 'No lock-in', body: 'Everything built is yours. Documented and handed off so it runs without depending on ZeisWorks.' },
          { label: 'Plain English on everything', body: 'No jargon, no vague deliverables. You get clear explanations of what\'s being built and why.' },
        ].map(item => (
          <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
            <span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange shrink-0"></span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-ink font-medium">{item.label}.</strong>{' '}
              <span class="text-ink-mid text-sm">{item.body}</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Background -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4">Background</h2>
      <div class="space-y-3 text-ink-mid leading-relaxed">
        <p>Six years building sales and marketing systems for organizations across healthcare, professional services, trades, real estate, and finance. The work spans CRM builds, Python automation, custom workflows, web development, marketing campaign management, and data infrastructure. The common thread is helping small teams do more with less friction.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4">
          {['HubSpot', 'Python', 'n8n', 'Zapier', 'Google Ads', 'Meta Ads', 'Astro', 'SQL', 'Google Business Profile', 'Ahrefs'].map(skill => (
            <span class="text-xs bg-cream-dark text-ink-mid px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-cream-dark">{skill}</span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact CTA -->
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-navy/20 bg-navy/5 p-8">
      <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Free first call. No obligation.</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-mid mb-6 leading-relaxed">
        Tell me what you're trying to fix. I'll come back with a plain-English plan: what I'd do, how long it takes, what it costs. No charge for any of that.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <button type="button" data-modal="gap-analysis" class="inline-block bg-navy text-cream text-sm px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-navy/90 transition-colors cursor-pointer border-0">
          Get in touch
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
